---
// Footer component - Talisay Integrated School Record Management System
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-[#070e0a] border-t border-[#1f3627] text-slate-400 text-xs py-14">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 pb-12 border-b border-[#172b1e]">
      
      <!-- Brand & One Sentence Summary -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img
            src="/tis_logo.png"
            alt="Talisay Integrated School Seal"
            class="h-10 w-10 object-contain drop-shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(22,163,74,0.3)]"
          />
          <div>
            <span class="font-display text-base font-bold text-white tracking-tight">TIS RMS</span>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-amber-400 font-semibold tracking-wide">
              Talisay Integrated School • Tiaong, Quezon
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          A client-server school Record Management System designed for <strong>Talisay Integrated School in Tiaong, Quezon, Philippines</strong>. Dedicated to managing and digitizing historical student records from old documents dated <strong>2021 onwards</strong>. Utilizes SF-10 and SF-9 forms for efficient basic student info registration with zero grade tracking.
        </p>

        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-[#112017] px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-400 border border-[#23412f]">
          <span>App Identity:</span>
          <span class="text-[#4ade80] font-semibold">plsp.bsit3dsb.tisrms</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Navigation Links -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-200">System Navigation</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li><a href="#showcase" class="hover:text-[#4ade80] transition">App Showcase</a></li>
          <li><a href="#school-forms" class="hover:text-[#4ade80] transition">SF-10 & SF-9 Records</a></li>
          <li><a href="#ocr-pipeline" class="hover:text-[#4ade80] transition">OCR Document Engine</a></li>
          <li><a href="#features" class="hover:text-[#4ade80] transition">System Features</a></li>
          <li><a href="#architecture" class="hover:text-[#4ade80] transition">Campus LAN Offline Mode</a></li>
          <li><a href="#tech-stack" class="hover:text-[#4ade80] transition">System Architecture</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Release & Distribution Links -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-200">Release & Distribution</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/ssbg04/TIS_RMS/releases/latest" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-[#4ade80] transition">
              Windows Desktop Installer (.exe)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/ssbg04/TIS_RMS/releases/download/v1.0.0/TIS_RMS_Android_Universal.apk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-[#4ade80] transition">
              Android Universal APK (.apk)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/ssbg04/TIS_RMS" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-[#4ade80] transition">
              GitHub Repository (ssbg04/TIS_RMS)
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Developed by <strong class="text-white">BSIT3DSB</strong> for Talisay Integrated School</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar -->
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px]">
      <div>
        © {currentYear} Talisay Integrated School — Record Management System (TIS RMS). Tiaong, Quezon, Philippines.
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <a href="#downloads" class="hover:text-white transition">Downloads</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/ssbg04/TIS_RMS" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-white transition">GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
